---

This project is a port of kismet-analyzer
(https://github.com/trumank/kismet-analyzer) by Truman Kilen, which is
distributed under the MIT License reproduced above. The original targets
Unreal Engine 4 assets through UAssetAPI and analyzes Blueprint bytecode;
this port targets Unreal Engine 3 package version 576 and reads the package
format directly.
